{"id":70337,"date":"2025-10-31T07:36:29","date_gmt":"2025-10-31T06:36:29","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70337"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:28:23","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:28:23","slug":"sao-silvestre-melides","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-melides\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Melides \u2013 Edi\u00e7\u00e3o 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Melides \u2013 Edi\u00e7\u00e3o 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Melides \u2013 Edi\u00e7\u00e3o 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/strong> (S\u00e1bado), com partidas e chegadas no <strong>Campo de Futebol de Melides (Campo do Castelo)<\/strong>, na freguesia de <strong>Melides<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Gr\u00e2ndola<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Set\u00fabal<\/strong>. A <strong>Corrida de 10 km<\/strong> parte \u00e0s <strong>17:00<\/strong>, seguida \u00e0s <strong>17:05<\/strong> pela <strong>Caminhada de 5 km<\/strong>, antecedidas por uma sess\u00e3o de aquecimento \u00e0s 16:30.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Inserida na pitoresca aldeia alentejana de <strong>Melides<\/strong> \u2014 c\u00e9lebre pela sua lagoa costeira, pelos pinhais litorais do concelho de Gr\u00e2ndola e pelo casario branco tradicional \u2014, a prova desenrola-se ao final da tarde e in\u00edcio da noite num tra\u00e7ado misto que combina alcatr\u00e3o, cal\u00e7ada, terra batida e estrad\u00e3o, sendo aconselhado o uso de frontal ou lanterna. Todos os inscritos t\u00eam direito a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, dorsal, seguro, abastecimentos, duche quente e uma reconfortante refei\u00e7\u00e3o ligeira com caldo verde e bifana.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pela <strong>Juventude Desportiva Melidense (JDM)<\/strong> com o apoio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Melides<\/strong> e da <strong>C\u00e2mara Municipal de Gr\u00e2ndola<\/strong>, atribuindo trof\u00e9us aos tr\u00eas primeiros classificados da geral (masculinos e femininos), aos tr\u00eas primeiros de cada um dos nove escal\u00f5es et\u00e1rios e \u00e0s tr\u00eas melhores equipas na corrida de 10 km. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">5 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Campo de Futebol de Melides (Campo do Castelo), Melides, Gr\u00e2ndola, Set\u00fabal<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-w